meta {
  name: Local Search
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/search/local
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "query": "Какой диагноз и какие препараты назначены пациенту Иванову И.И.?",
    "top_k": 10
  }
}

docs {
  # POST /api/v1/search/local

  **Plan-execute-synthesize** (the default search). Decomposes the
  question into sub-questions, retrieves each in parallel, merges +
  dedups, runs a bounded coverage gate, reranks, then synthesizes once
  on the large-tier model. No ReAct loop.

  ## When to use
  Concrete facts answerable from a few chunks: «кто/что/когда/сколько у X»,
  lookups of a specific entity / document / value / definition. Default
  for most queries.

  ## Request body
  - **query** *(required)* — the question (answer is forced Russian).
  - **top_k** *(default 10)* — chunks pulled per sub-question.

  ## Response 200 — `SearchResponse`
  ```json
  {
    "query": "...",
    "answer": "...",
    "mode": "local",
    "sources": [
      { "doc_id": "...", "chunk_id": "...", "content": "...", "score": 0.42 }
    ],
    "latency_ms": 4213.0
  }
  ```

  ## Tuning (server-side env, needs API/worker restart)
  `AGENT_MAX_SUBQUERIES` (fan-out), `AGENT_COVERAGE_CHECK_ENABLED` /
  `AGENT_MAX_COVERAGE_ROUNDS` (gap-filling), `TEMPORAL_RERANK_TOP_N`
  (synthesis context size).

  ## Errors
  - `401` — auth. `500` — workflow raised (body carries the message).
}
